{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52584","headline":"歌 · 万回","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黑白两回开佛眼，不系一法出莲丛。\n真空不坏灵智性，妙用恒常无作功。\n圣智本来成佛道，寂光非照自圆通。\n（见《大正新修大藏经》第四十八册吴越释延寿《宗镜录》卷十八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万回","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}